       browser otherwise hangs onto the cached pages.css indefinitely
       (no fingerprinting / ETag-only validation isn't enough on hot
       reload, and contributors hit "menu has no styles" repeatedly
       after the ProfileMenu refactor). Increment whenever a hot-cache
       miss matters for the UI. *@
